# Normalise line endings so the repository always stores LF, whatever each
# contributor's `core.autocrlf` is set to. Prettier and .editorconfig both
# enforce LF; without this, a Windows checkout would rewrite every file to CRLF
# and show the whole tree as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
